{"title": "Devour (Shambling Mound)", "pageid": 35404, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Devour_(Shambling_Mound)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the version of the ability available to Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mounds. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Devour (disambiguation)\">Devour (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Bite.webp/300px-Bite.webp, /w/images/8/86/Bite.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Bite.webp/300px-Bite.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Devour</b> is a class action used by <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Shambling_Mound\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound\">Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound</a>. This ability allows the shambling mound to devour and instantly kill a creature that is restrained and covered in digestive juices.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nDevour a creature that's <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(status_group)\" title=\"Restrained (status group)\">Restrained</a> and marinating in your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Juices_(Condition)\" title=\"Digestive Juices (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Digestive Juices\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Juices_(Condition)\" title=\"Digestive Juices (Condition)\">Digestive Juices</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Devour_ShadowMound</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Devour_ShadowMound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Devour_ShadowMound\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Shambling_Mound\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound\">Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound can use the potent combination of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Sap\" title=\"Digestive Sap\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Digestive Sap\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Acid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Generic_Acid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Sap\" title=\"Digestive Sap\">Digestive Sap</a> and Devour in a single turn. It will target any restrained creature with Digestive Sap (who will roll the saving throw at <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> due to being restrained). If successful, it will immediately follow up with Devour and instantly kill the target. As a result, it is important to avoid being restrained in the first place. This is most easily accomplished with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_of_Movement\" title=\"Freedom of Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/20px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/30px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/40px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Freedom of Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/20px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_of_Movement\" title=\"Freedom of Movement\">Freedom of Movement</a> or <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Free_Action\" title=\"Ring of Free Action\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Ring_of_Free_Action_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Free_Action\" title=\"Ring of Free Action\">Ring of Free Action</a>.</li>\n<li>Before Patch 6, Devour dealt <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">10d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> instead of killing the target instantly.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043437\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3282/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36776/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14871/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1622068/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.402      1 -total\n 98.83%   65.625      1 Template:Feature_page\n 70.91%   47.083     44 Template:Trim\n 17.57%   11.669      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 17.14%   11.380      7 Template:Icon_text\n 12.04%    7.995      5 Template:Icon_link\n 11.43%    7.591      1 Template:Resou